I understand the frustration! It sounds like your input field isn't clearing after you add a task.

The way you have written it, the `value` of `#taskInput` will become empty only when you interact with the DOM-managed element next time. However, most modern implementations expect you to using `.value` as `""` after insertion.

**Quick Fix:** Add:

```javascript
input.value = '';
```

